Description: library discovery layer for Koha and other ILSs
 Aspen Discovery is a full featured discovery system for libraries with
 catalog search, e-content integrations, events and website indexing.
 .
 This package ships the PHP web application, the java extract and index
 daemons, a bundled Solr, the site templates, and administration tools.
 Each site's Solr and background daemons run as their own systemd units,
 grouped by an aspen@<site>.target per site and a global aspen.target.
 .
 The PHP 8.4 dependencies come from the deb.sury.org repository, which
 must be configured before installing this package. See README.Debian.
